DTSTAMP:20261027T020342Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:Early voting opens (Kentucky)
DESCRIPTION:Any voter can vote early in person on Thursday\, Oct. 29\, Fri
 day\, Oct. 30\, and Saturday\, Oct. 31. Your county sets the places and h
 ours. Voters with an approved excuse could also vote in person Oct. 21 to
  23 and Oct. 26 to 28.\nMore: https://vrsws.sos.ky.gov/vic/\nFrom The Civ
 ic Forecast: https://civic-forecast.pages.dev
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://vrsws.sos.ky.gov/vic/
END:VEVENT
