SUMMARY:Tax Day: 2027 returns are due
DESCRIPTION:Federal income tax returns are due\, and so is any tax you owe
 . If you need more time to file\, request an extension by today. An exten
 sion gives you more time to file\, not to pay.\nMore: https://www.irs.gov
 /filing/individuals/when-to-file\nFrom The Civic Forecast: https://civic-
 forecast.pages.dev
