SUMMARY:2028 presidential primary (Kentucky)
DESCRIPTION:Kentucky holds its presidential primary on the same day as its
  regular May primary\, the first Tuesday after the third Monday in May. T
 he date is worked out from state law (KRS 118.025 and 118.561)\, not yet 
 posted on a published 2028 calendar.\nMore: https://apps.legislature.ky.g
 ov/law/statutes/statute.aspx?id=27658\nFrom The Civic Forecast: https://c
 ivic-forecast.pages.dev
